{
  "name": "Find decision makers (CEO, founders, VPs) for a list of company domains and save them to Google Sheets with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## Find decision makers for a list of company domains\n\n### Who's it for\nOutbound and ABM teams who have target accounts as website domains and need the people to contact: founders, C-level, VPs and directors, with LinkedIn URLs, without Sales Navigator.\n\n### How it works\n1. Reads the `domain` column of your Google Sheet (acme.com).\n2. Runs **Decision Maker Finder by Domain** (`b2bsearch/domain-to-decision-makers`) on Apify for the whole list: founders and CEOs first, then C-level, VPs and directors, up to a cap per company. Rows come from a database of professional profiles, no scraping.\n3. Appends one row per person to a results sheet: name, title, seniority, company, LinkedIn URL and whether a work email is on record.\n\n### Setup steps\n- Add your Apify credential to the Apify node.\n- Pick the input sheet (column `domain`) and the output sheet.\n- Optional: change `roles` (founder, cxo, vp, director) and `maxPerCompany` in the Apify node body, or add `titleKeywords` such as [\"marketing\", \"sales\"].\n\n### Requirements\n- Apify account. $3.20 per 1,000 people delivered; companies with nobody matching are free rows. 100 domains at 5 people each cost at most $1.60.\n- Google Sheets credential.\n- For email addresses, pass the `linkedinUrl` column to the LinkedIn Email Finder template.\n\n### Disclosure\nThe Apify Actor in this template is built by the author of the template. It is pay per result: a miss is a free row."
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -900,
        -220
      ]
    },
